0ubGl0ZW9yYW5nZS5ob21ldG9waWEQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Frost Valley: Merge \\u0026amp; Story—a cozy place recovering from a long, chilly winter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe frost may have slowed things down, but with a little help, warmth and color are ready to return.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge items, follow story steps, and enjoy watching each frozen corner feel alive again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlong the way, you’ll meet friends who are starting over and happy to have your help.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge to Discover\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, drag, and merge to uncover bigger, better, and more exciting items.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect merged items to advance chapters, unlock new scenes, and restore each space step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore to Revive\\u003cbr\\u003eFix up frosty homes and make each space feel warm and welcoming again.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach repair opens new rooms and scenes, gently showing the valley coming back to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay to Reward\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin cozy in-game events with new characters, festive themes, and fun little stories.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect special rewards that add fun surprises and new moments to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your journey today and help Frost Valley find its warmth again—one merge at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.liteorange.co/ps.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.liteorange.co/terms.html\"],\"Tuyoo Games (HK) Limited\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nxjFTKu2zkGda6GGffv2Fa_2HREVW6m3EkpHszyPQhglvZww9-g0zi4T7vj2I4dSnIzZsu__ZLomxM71bo5IxA\"],null,[196,210,216,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Mild Swearing\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 3.99 - RM 419.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.plug.runner.battery.mates\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ST_8FIgzNFD6O4iz5aZ9oVDXMGJxJQHsGHjQj4tktTpxhZR5BR94sO37iATgnPYxxOQdS7OYNNevvy-lUS9Fww\"],null,[6,121,241,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[998,561],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T9OEGRr-VB0htVfcZ5ifjtz3O97HoIwVlawgbWjZllnlEyLdh1NwNIomqfZICIgLyzTGG75aWUjmgj49y1oylw\"]],[null,2,[995,560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xCJK4D2pSyXeH6c83dzoWluxyR9-n_njYlQgp6ALuTgaeuFsJZJx3ygE93g33RWcfWzeMv7pXEx0V8Yk-1CC38g\"]],[null,2,[995,559],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PZhgwM6RajmRKy9GJ81sLHDMbKYGvWEFkfpYnfeqqUTGvCPCI6QRLEspDzLj6LG1CPx1tpR-ttYzQUs0TgFQzg\"]],[null,2,[995,560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/063u84cLPCPjH2XvzZ12PzUOho143s6XY1FboQuTxzmSgIxjBMGpHxr8KlnKt2O2ziQfQRpxf8Rcm0CbAl3p\"]]],\"Plug Runner\",[\"3.6\",3.6216216],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIH0oTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tR0IQALoCPwojCh1jb20ucGx1Zy5ydW5uZXIuYmF0dGVyeS5tYXRlcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"⚡ Get ready for the most electrifying race of your life! ⚡\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Plug Runner, the ultimate racing game where energy is everything! Take control of your plug character, charge up, and dash your way to victory in this highly addictive and fun competition! 🏃\\u200d♂️💨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔋 COLLECT \\u0026amp; GROW HUGE!\\u003cbr\\u003eRun across the track and collect batteries that match your color. The more you collect, the bigger and stronger you become! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚤 POWER UP VEHICLES \\u0026amp; OVERCOME OBSTACLES!\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;re not just running—you are the power source! Use your energy to plug into awesome vehicles like cars, speedboats, and motorcycles, or use your raw power to smash through massive brick walls! 🧱🏍️\\u003cbr\\u003eCareful though! Powering these obstacles drains your energy and makes you shrink. You\\u0026#39;ll need to keep collecting batteries to stay in the race!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 SMASH YOUR RIVALS!\\u003cbr\\u003eSize matters in Plug Runner! If you are bigger and stronger than your opponents, bump into them to knock them down! 🥊 They will stay on the ground for a few seconds and drop special Black Batteries that anyone can collect for a massive power boost. Show no mercy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 BE THE FIRST TO FINISH!\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s a thrilling dash to the end. Power through the obstacles, manage your energy wisely, outsmart your rivals, and be the first to cross the finish line to claim the crown! 👑\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ GAME FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple \\u0026amp; Addictive: Easy one-finger swipe controls, perfect for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Vibrant 3D Graphics: Colorful paths, satisfying animations, and dynamic gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Epic Power-Ups: Steer boats, ride bikes, and break walls!\\u003cbr\\u003e🥊 Fun Combat Mechanic: Knock down smaller players and steal their energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Endless Racing Fun: Multiple levels with different challenges to test your skills!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you fully charged and ready to run? ⚡ Download Plug Runner NOW and electrify the competition! 🔌🏁\"],\"AbbaYosua.Design\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Mp8IMSw2z47-vf8UwqDBzzbgRXX5TzEg_hLcrjnioOWWAn83F73IYhhldW_VO8PfKlvM2-pHrOlnZm7UWRX\"],null,[222,200,87,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u00