3\",4.314879],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\"]],[\"qgJ2GnQINEoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAIgCAboCPgocChZjb20uYnViYWR1LnN1cGVybWFya2V0EAEYAxIeCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQIBhABCgQICxABygIECAEQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"eFV9A9lsT6I\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:eFV9A9lsT6I?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:eFV9A9lsT6I\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmWoWsrUus5CvsBQmWdCK_yA_-vw837HcsqfdjSEHrUHbfl15Jm5nNw4ey36PKNApBIplj_g3NbQUQqG_BZ8FUmai2Danv8BV_l8pwDsL2DM2oadPQM0d3_sAHSHXCQ4axQg43hevbBRgYtT3RakAGRmbTCtXkENJu7bszh5IT9ocUUPy1YMaX1OrTKDSxKUkDpd9n5bJCPdh5-s1QeLVJPeqN2q1VcSIwFNqvuZmP00XTGweKPNStBbYtblgpjkeN48Pzgcdjz9oEyBzNtQmKn2JR6PQfVk7lwsgkvd7OXrQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eFV9A9lsT6I/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the shopping paradise! Explore the supermarket world with many popular mini-games. Help your customers shop and get ready for some fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThis supermarket has a lot of sections: a cash register, departments for grocery, cheese and salami, fruits and vegetables, sweets, and toys, a recycling area and other. Do all the necessary tasks and provide superb shopping services to meet your customers’ needs.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e• Cash register: Have fun scanning items and issuing invoices. Learn about numbers and make sure to get the right amount of money, just like a real cashier.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Grocery: Keep your eyes peeled in a fun game with hidden objects where you must find foods and drinks like a cake, lollipop, chocolate, juice, spaghetti and many more. Help your customers find what they need.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cheese and salami: Sort different types of salami and cheese from the conveyor belt. Drag every item to its box and be the fastest sorter in your shop.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fruits and vegetables: Pick up fresh fruits and vegetables and avoid the rotten ones. Collect bananas, strawberries, tomatoes, carrots and other healthy foods.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Candies: Candy section is always the sweetest part of the supermarket. Be accurate and fill the passing cups with a variety of candies.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Weigh-in: Pack fruits and vegetables in bags, put the right quantity on the scale and weigh it. Watch the screen on the scale and avoid red numbers.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Recycling: Save the world from being polluted by learning how to recycle and sort your waste. Place the items correctly in different recycling bins: paper, plastic, glass, battery and organic.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Toy catcher: Use navigation buttons to move the claw and hit the red button to scoop it up. Enjoy grabbing toys in a toy catcher machine.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Delivery: Drive a delivery truck on the five-lane road and deliver packages. Test your driving skills and rush through the crazy traffic as fast as possible.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Catch a thief: Become a superhero and catch a thief in the supermarket. You have to be quick!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eKeep your supermarket under control and become the best storekeeper in this shopping game!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e• fun and easy to play\\u003cbr\\u003e• beautiful graphics and friendly UI\\u003cbr\\u003e• attractive animations and sound effects\\u003cbr\\u003e• 10 popular mini-games and shopping areas\\u003cbr\\u003e• challenging achievements with bronze, silver and gold medals\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is free to play but certain in-game items and features, also some of those mentioned in game description, may require payment via in-app purchases which cost real money. Please check your device settings for more detailed options regarding in-app purchases.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game contains advertising for Bubadu’s products or some third parties which will redirect users to our or third-party site or app.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is certified compliant with the Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) by FTC approved COPPA safe harbor PRIVO. If you would like to know more about the measures we have in place for protecting child privacy please see our policies here: https://bubadu.com/privacy-policy.shtml .\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of service: https://bubadu.com/tos.shtml\"],\"FM by Bubadu\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"Ages 6-8\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gOQfeKslOJyvPBUtIcbPVfjLe89wHtjFiZVGXx4OpttRpifWll0LR9pkfjOFNpxUlr1qsHqEEzSddZZ8iDWSLkk\"],null,[240,131,5,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 4.99 - RM 18.99 per item\",[false]],null,null,null,[[[[\"playpass_family\",39]]],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/pass\"]]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.pronetis.ironball2\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a8zcuqCydhNbHi-lsqas4V3G93TRcglFCFmS65IH7bUcaPx_o8bpTfDX0jTjFiVDS2Jhsd9VKJr85FQiEG-gumk\"],null,[47,219,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/acdsh0eJUQaIs0Se9Ai-7ZbL8WLoG287qX1n_gLAQSZWQgYlgtOvniDzjeF3qAB-BK3uJu1xEc0EZs5fSg0L\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZmHS8kj8z-33amNNB8gdhgYoRBPhHA6J5wlnJI6vc7HRRus_34BK3MtQYWfes7Vac9Swjq55zWN2tJ9xWhcZb30\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VcB5ensrrxjxzDsiS_THAAE0Njm9lWDE_EVkjV4r-YrIl70dI8jOikBOeUB67iiiWVQ2-d6mQL4LEA1jrfNu0Q8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D84zaV3Eyt-Kfq4JQMVltROQj7QRoPGDzKOr0dtkALUuSTxchrg6n6fYKxAgm0gmMdR7U09GO4k63njy3M49djs\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gyJL-BbK2JqM7zewOqbpbRpwBVPPZuf79GEBvUmE7aYqZktgYBFpDDKpCCaM2JpBaTHVzUY-y7CbopJji74t7w\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7SLQoOAwY-xwMf90ROh2-EoVnpAJBye01NUCVihhVSSiBT1k-VoErN0ReNcUkFLFCyn3aH60Bn6iSa5jrwPacA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AfMZ5H14FFn5nftGvuXuJwomfeZQ6J4Q6Qe87DDIdcedh2dlVECvsuRJhxabMCwixt_7yGmQdzNUTHL5GQgnJ7Y\"]]],\"Going Balls\",[\"4.2\",4.2276177],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pronetis.ironball2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.pronetis.ironball2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pronetis.ironball2\"]],[\"qgJmGmQINUoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAocChZjb20ucHJvbmV0aXMuaXJvbmJhbGwyEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Going Balls: The Ultimate Speed and Balance Challenge! 🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready for a high-speed runner game that tests your reflexes and mastery of physics? Download Going Balls today and experience the most thrilling arcade adventure on mobile! Join millions of players worldwide in this addictive hyper-casual hit.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat is Going Balls? ⚽️🏃\\u200d♂️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGoing Balls is an exhilarating, fast-paced ball game where your main goal is to control a rolling ball and guide it safely to the finish line on increasingly difficult tracks. It’s the perfect blend of a precision puzzle game and a heart-pounding speed challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003eSwipe your screen to control the speed and direction of your ball. Master the art of balance as you navigate narrow paths, dodge unexpected obstacles (challenge!), and collect coins 💰 to unlock new balls and environments. \\u003cbr\\u003eThe simple controls hide a deep, skill-based arcade experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features: The Ultimate Rolling Adventure! 🚧\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Dozens of Challenging Levels: Race through diverse worlds, from sky-high platforms to treacherous industrial zones. Each level offers a unique challenge that will keep you coming back for more!\\u003cbr\\u003e* Realistic Physics Engine: Feel the thrill of true physics-based gameplay. Every roll, jump, and acceleration feels incredibly smooth and responsive. Balance is key to surviving!\\u003cbr\\u003e* Customize Your Ball: Collect thousands of coins and unlock a massive collection of cool, colorful, and unique balls. Personalize your runner experience! 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e* Intuitive One-Finger Control: The ultimate pick-up-and-play hyper-casual design. Simple to learn, but incredibly hard to master - perfect for quick bursts of fun or long endless sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Tons of Obstacles: Avoid swinging hammers, tricky ramps, massive wrecking balls, and unexpected gaps. Your speed and precision are your only allies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Going Balls! 🎉\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGoing Balls is more than just a runner - it\\u0026#39;s an immensely satisfying experience. The rush of barely making a jump, the joy of collecting a huge stack of coins, and the feeling of accomplishment after conquering a nearly impossible challenge makes this game highly addictive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe’ve optimized the gameplay for pure fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e* Instant Thrills: Short, intense levels make it ideal for quick breaks.\\u003cbr\\u003eSkill Progression: You can feel yourself getting better at speed and balance with every attempt.\\u003cbr\\u003e* High Replayability: The pursuit of the perfect, flawless run is endless!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Now - Totally FREE! 💯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to roll? Get the full arcade experience without spending a dime! \\u003cbr\\u003eGoing Balls is totally free to download and play. Experience the ultimate physics-based challenge today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Going Balls and start your speed adventure now! ⬇️\"],\"Supersonic Studios LTD\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hLdbXJX2Ve8w6pvnmCd1KwgBQtyTDiAgSgzygdixQZHdPFen4zSa681b9dbjTRIwJEWMGd5vcX0PWH9g2YT3_w\"],null,[190,199,216,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pronetis.ironball2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.pronetis.ironball2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 3.99 - RM 134.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.outfit7.mytalkinghank\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1HHH9fHxlfYPJAscKFRS7FV7gX1lpWsPzWokQRtMVa7W0hUlkTM329y9sahLqggG7YtM4B0v9CLlFQOR53Fj6g\"],null,[242,240,239,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gMByYuwGY44Ss6vEPeupXxasnxkxG-5z7RbUNQrFAy896Nd5FiJWMBT4ujJC3QR6-PZAPX9TSsd7dAQa25JRtQ\"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IOVWIE_-FmXXgq0nEEhVVrqv0h8b1b3mC9uT7stMANI1CLJrz93Q5lHbOIngqDvb3MGL2iM_QIc3Yy2J15SveGE\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-WL8nAcRtnbB4MLXersoxmw8OTcmGMyQyZtXTECphsJZe_ka7hjdqx8b4yVJEzhLaKvkkZpD7ojNG58hBT5UbQ\"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[nu