                           \\u003cbr\\u003eGameplay:\\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                                                                                                      \\u003cbr\\u003e1. Click to eliminate three identical blocks, and the corresponding quantity will be reduced in the order\\u003cbr\\u003e2. The order content for each level is different and randomly generated\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Complete all orders and pass the levels\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Use powerful props to quickly help you reduce difficulty and complete orders quickly!\\u003cbr\\u003e5. More interesting levels are waiting for you to challenge!\\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                                                                                               \\u003cbr\\u003eIsland Match can help you exercise and improve your strategic and intellectual abilities. If you enjoy elimination and challenging yourself, don\\u0026#39;t miss out on this game\\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                                                                                                 \\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now! Experience a brand new elimination game full of unique flavors, with diverse levels and rewards that will definitely bring you a great gaming experience.\"],\"Fireflyy\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/svBAzh_wQW4jsqkgMBgf8av8b5TVN6mDd1mOTT5r62KQdVMbVFpuTZ-tbf-3pGyq1Q2l5n0x9jHiNYfh14pftQ\"],null,[118,48,168,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Sexual Violence, Sex, Nudity\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e