a7y0e7m45vdpmVRMfJduBkF67cb8_yLTmzGBruti_TPyW5v5zBeiE5RdP1iVwx0GXkYMVh8rvjrjpMBJZR0FdT3EJsSbAYtzp-ckJR8jcbJoyv52BIcb82rFoARej2f4gs6DCZBkjhdV1kN3ldfNiYLFYoaDpfiK39xjUQZT5WMLMjD8w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kb4aTBEh6Tc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Step into the New Generation of Minion Rush!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience the ultimate endless running adventure in Minion Rush! With updated new features, exciting challenges, and nonstop fun from Illumination\\u0026#39;s Minions franchise, this refreshed game is bigger, bolder, and better than ever!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Fresh New Look\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover updated visuals and a sleek, modern new design! From reimagined locations to revamped adventures, every detail has been updated to keep the excitement flowing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless Run Mode\\u003cbr\\u003eJump straight into action with the brand-new ENDLESS RUN! Test your skills, break records, and collect epic rewards. Every run is your chance to shine!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eProgress with the Hall of Jam\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect bananas to unlock new locations, costumes, and features. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect and Upgrade Minion Costumes\\u003cbr\\u003eRun in style with unique Minion costumes! Unlock themed collections for extra bonuses. Collect exclusive stickers to expand your wardrobe and boost your runs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGadgets and Power-Ups\\u003cbr\\u003ePair costumes with clever Gadgets for strategic fun! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePower-Up Your Runs \\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock power-ups to supercharge your runs and go farther and faster!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExciting Tournaments\\u003cbr\\u003eShow off your skills in daily and weekly tournaments! Climb the leaderboards, earn legendary rewards, and compete with players worldwide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve Story Puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003eSTORY PUZZLES let you relive your favorite Minions movies by collecting puzzle pieces during your runs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePersonalized Profiles\\u003cbr\\u003eStand out with customizable Player Profiles! Choose your nickname, avatar, and frame to showcase your progress in style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin more than a billion players and experience endless mischief, mayhem, and fun in Minion Rush! Download now and start your adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: http://www.gameloft.com/en/privacy-notice\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: http://www.gameloft.com/en/conditions-of-use\\u003cbr\\u003eEnd-User License Agreement: http://www.gameloft.com/en/eula\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDisabling password protection may result in unauthorized purchases. We strongly encourage you to keep password protection turned on if you have children or if others could have access to your device.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game contains advertising for Gameloft’s products or some third parties, which will redirect you to a third-party site. You can disable your device\\u0026#39;s ad identifier being used for interest-based advertising in the settings menu of your device. This option can be found in the Settings app \\u0026gt; Accounts (Personal) \\u0026gt; Google \\u0026gt; Ads (Settings and Privacy) \\u0026gt; Opt out of interest-based ads.\\u003cbr\\u003eCertain aspects of this game will require players to connect to the Internet.\"],\"Gameloft SE\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Wje5ekzZPKuRUzv_v18U1gLJ3HBL1Btq4mSeRarYli3Hry0Eji-qDj11YwdUA77vsWtRCq0SK3CCY0pjGuGa8y8\"],null,[33,18,157,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[n