IONSHIP simulation game! ❤️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis interactive game lets you LIVE your stories with love, romance, adventure, and drama. You get to make choices and choose your destiny.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelationship is so much fun! But a lot of dramas can happen in a relationship.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Are you in your honeymoon phase, and you always want to be together?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Do you play passionate and dirty games?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Do you prank your other half?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Do you cheat on each other?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this game, you can experience all kinds of dramatic events and make your own decisions!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURE:\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Beautiful 3D graphics\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ 100% free game\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Fun and addictive gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Easy control\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDOWNLOAD FOR FREE NOW! Play through many levels of fun challenges between couples! Take your Couple Life to the next Level!\"],\"Mille Crepe Studios Co., Ltd.\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vlGZ4lJahFcibjfbAuBbvQnoRR7anv9bEhTGIrXXD2WYPy0pMLX3CBFg0xwQBlQGgMcRKkOsorSjsWhOC2pj\"],null,[187,63,201,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Sexual Innuendo\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play