FPo-Z4AtDr55bFu5IReGhETrAhryYfyQQmqJBB77Y8KW7nGU17BgZrZLuJhZT3MCrzvn\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KotqBCVwUFXNQ6WDBkQ_hwhKijoitCuigqFpE9At_7rhqJkpVqyOISkKAooaYSYZVJdxzh1w8Y6Qlp7uVKtOxw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fUB21-72HEAZkJRIHwGhkUU-gfT3WSF29ZISXmJgZo2z_0_4e0qq7VyVYvvT3oUFCt8yI7LWM_SJp3O13LZhsg\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c5OCuJy-XuJqefYfoO4KiveMHCIOs7jGe2riEOFdOOCYOnB-06c1wS88lKisMw2R9tp_Uj76T8zXmHi_OV9mfA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J7gQnGkIkeCP9Hmt1LA635zxzjB0-I_IBilWuSQB4vOc4xLN-XsjlCDiMexXgbvoWm40JfxPiVvvrJZMrLD8mw\"]]],\"Bottle Flip 3D — Tap \\u0026 Jump\",[\"4.1\",4.1477],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dpampam.ibf2\\u0026rdid\\u003dpampam.ibf2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dpampam.ibf2\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIPkoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBFwoVCM6o58WWwoONQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIzChEKC3BhbXBhbS5pYmYyEAEYAxIeCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQIBhABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"atwg-I3TkfM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:atwg-I3TkfM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:atwg-I3TkfM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlTkkv88vei3BrEnrJomND-iZPJabn677MX6_7OuE29cNONbWLDn8PGNh2I0nuneXnzI20IJ2WKL-r9g_tytA733tBift-0TUnfwr-RsfDRnHkU3-lJ5osik5laB97MS8pLADJJu5iEBWz_44CjeJ8fcQO_2A2fY9dm1t4XGHRrkbTlMzIiSCfcPV2uoXjWSH3JkHegvawZypN9G5LTtEqYaXc1TvRayZmzg5IXgoLN_tZpoHae4MaSuuxBtfSMCRN3rdVtR9KnO6oLPtgdc7wqIFjq7oWZ0OvTOkP8rpvfxg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/atwg-I3TkfM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Bottle Flip 3D is an addictive arcade game that puts your skills to the test. Your goal is to flip a plastic bottle and make it land on various objects without falling. Sounds easy, right? Well, think again! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’ll need to tap the screen at the right moment to make the bottle jump, flip, and bounce through a series of rooms filled with obstacles. Shelves, tables, chairs, sofas, and even subwoofers — you\\u0026#39;ll have to use everything as a platform for your bottle. But be careful; some objects are more tricky than others! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is not only fun, but also a great way to train your agility and coordination. A key to success is to calculate the jump distance correctly. Only then will you reach the finish line and win! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures: \\u003cbr\\u003e- Bottle Flip 3D is a challenging and entertaining hyper-casual arcade game that will keep you hooked for hours! \\u003cbr\\u003e- Flip various bottles and explore different rooms with unique themes and designs. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap the screen at the right moment and watch your bottle fly, spin, and land on various objects. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Test your skills and see if you can flip a bottle like a pro! \\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy the stunning graphics, realistic physics, and catchy sound effects. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Experience the thrill of completing each level and unlocking new ones. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith Bottle Flip 3D, you’ll never get bored! There’s always a new challenge, a different obstacle, and a chance for you to show off your amazing flips. Enjoy the game!\"],\"Azur Interactive Games Limited\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uNTTNJ2FaH8Txz1yQJU4phPFlwDEx3dEWQZh61zGkZszKJc47Sm_5n84b0G37-UdiXa254Wm7Mm65R-v4mx6SVs\"],null,[210,188,168,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM9