 this ultimate satisfying cleaning game!\"],\"Game District LLC\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KkcYlNfNeZzSO8RD5yC0SqXU7WweQ-A_tghI8GtdFcR7BZ54v4B7sZc2PcJ6BV_kpCjqJenJSvdoq1lNnE5bwg\"],null,[211,179,125,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hmbl.perfect.makeover.cleaning.asmr\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.hmbl.perfect.makeover.cleaning.asmr\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 4.49 - RM 21.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.arkgame.ft\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YM9wOV1SD50z_a0LUzehBK0E3vkklkan9UL_SS9MDwZqcsQfCQkgE6wi_krotEuWpgAB_t3Uv4j7tcNDqIXkoQ\"],null,[203,226,253,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2