ne, Dracula, Frosty, Santa or Snowman\\u003cbr\\u003e- Different kinds of gear, from slap hand to jetpack\\u003cbr\\u003e- Shapeshifting! You can become a firehorse and gallop through obby prison with ease!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFREE rewards:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Complete each escape map and get a free gear, complete 4 maps and get a cute pet that also removes all ads!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Amazing daily rewards: maps, gear, skins and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Timing rewards: every 5 minutes that you spend in the game, you can claim a free skin from lucky box!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Glass Bridge obby parkour challenge: complete famous glass bridge to claim a free skin from the chest at the end or simply use gear if you like cheating :)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready for thrilling action adventure and help Gugu Gaga Penguin complete all the obby that we have?\"],\"Kids Games LLC\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z_v7OdxBWaYrT0OUZvd9P0VxKMpmEOQaVbKw40Aiw9AVIhNlex-hktHpDst8TktTdlwNtqjlNKqjm_g_bO8cPQ\"],null,[190,145,162,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence, Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dobby.prison\\u0026rdid\\u003dobby.prison\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u0