UYNdV0DR2b_AXFLSP-u8jRUdVjNNj09K2T73umfNVBicz_uKxr46eMuHcxRMaHeNA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gdb425WHsFVah8Bc4yRUz8oLuTN1kFD25BoADjZuvw69Pdxri7wyTAs3OQ67JDrUESMbTmA4q__oQLN_H534QA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OoUpm_1KQL-1RRyhgtcn352se0_TpKuzpWyhfUVFOd25fVv0MFUMBRL3CfGoYnj0RQvlegNJvpLXPzyMNjBZ\"]]],\"Idol Livestream: Fashion Game\",[\"4.4\",4.4455447],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.idol.livestream.fashion.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.idol.livestream.fashion.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.idol.livestream.fashion.game\"]],[\"qgJwGm4IRkoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQgomCiBjb20uaWRvbC5saXZlc3RyZWFtLmZhc2hpb24uZ2FtZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"👗 Idol Livestream: Fashion Game lets you become a fashion designer for your very own doll! With a variety of clothes, accessories, and makeup options, you can create the perfect look for your doll to stand out. After styling your doll, send them off to join exciting competitions or participate in a live-streaming fashion show!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👚 How to play: Choose from an array of trendy clothes, stunning accessories, and beautiful hairstyles to dress up your doll. Once your doll is ready, they can join a fashion competition or go live in a thrilling livestream, where viewers will react to your design. The better your styling, the more positive reactions you’ll get, so get creative and impress the audience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Show off your creativity: Idol Livestream: Fashion Game is all about expressing your fashion sense and enjoying the excitement of live reactions. Will your doll become a star? Or will your design stand out in the competition? The more fashionable and creative you get, the more praise you’ll receive from viewers!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Ready to become a top designer and live-stream your stunning outfits? Download Idol Livestream: Fashion Game now and show the world your fashion skills!\"],\"kiwilab\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ud_HCJ-GkH-ZLzesHQkMVWd0aBD_Vw-nGU3e85d0Tnlt1Vy6a4gQ_2PVfvdol1DmbxiCB0pfZypdwnNVs7Kf\"],null,[241,238,240,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.idol.livestream.fashion.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.idol.livestream.fashion.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 13.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]]