gQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Mini Challenges: Calm Games, a fun collection of mini games made for pure relaxation and easy fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW IT WORKS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap the screen. That’s it.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple controls, zero learning curve\\u003cbr\\u003e- Short mini games. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini \\u0026amp; Classic Games Collection\\u003cbr\\u003e- Calm \\u0026amp; Antistress Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to Play, Tricky to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Always Fresh Fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re bored, stressed, or just scrolling for something fun, Mini Challenges: Calm Games is your go-to chill game collection!\"],\"UltraPub\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/db-pe3etYHMkyJp8L5hfsKLeXVq_ILud79Kc2LxSCt1kum1Gbhyahe1mM2pCwL5ba3DvoUoyl2mjqy42_--oIOo\"],null,[237,235,229,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.RC56.crafty.blox.world\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7tviKTCxykQjI4K30BLJeaEsdQoyJZV8XEgFjmvWrLcvF_5sONxpZfQ4cSZSpQ4msH2ZIU4H3obaW-u_hRJzMg\"],null,[126,120,114,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O1d6gOZYkseGcfqiIVqmiQQKwOwzIdHIlXLuJSxdDftMjkppVJ7lcAEZgGq4j63y0-FjBGfviCfWWtH6kClq7CU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LYwFu8VszHFWm7fN_27UV9ITK64y7bZO6UkFtkpF7JogO-O7vAbuDKImqIPlMMOOyYB7zdlRSDu-L-AJqEBsyA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Sdffq6BB6KMFwPD86e_mEio1NDCi6ARRgsMna0XXpc6hzQ7HEgGhQhpAxcvmG0EtIzG5UMkmi_-0uIpcoUqddmE\"]]],\"Crafty Blox World\",[\"3.7\",3.6666667],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIS0oTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPAogChpjb20uUkM1Ni5jcmFmdHkuYmxveC53b3JsZBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Crafty Blox World – The Ultimate Voxel Building \\u0026amp; Action Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a limitless pixelated universe where your creativity meets intense action! Crafty Blox World is an open-world sandbox simulator that combines the freedom of building with thrilling combat and survival elements. Whether you want to design massive structures or gear up to fight dangerous monsters, this blocky world has it all!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR DREAM WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your imagination with an extensive crafting and building system. Gather resources, mine materials, and place blocks to create anything from simple pixel shelters to majestic blocky castles. Shape the terrain and design your unique base down to the very last block.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eACTION, WEAPONS \\u0026amp; COMBAT\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn\\u0026#39;t just a peaceful building simulator—prepare for a challenge! Arm yourself with an arsenal of powerful weapons, from sharp melee swords to explosive firearms and bombs. Defend your territory against waves of fearsome monsters and hostile creatures that roam the land.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE \\u0026amp; SURVIVE\\u003cbr\\u003eVenture into diverse voxel landscapes filled with secrets, hidden materials, and unique biomes. Meet friendly villagers, tame mounts to travel faster, and discover mysterious ecosystems. Adapt, craft better gear, and conquer the ultimate survival test!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMassive Sandbox Freedom: Craft, build, and destroy in a fully interactive 3D voxel world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic Action Combat: Fight monsters using unique weapons, guns, and explosives.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRich Ecosystem: Encounter various friendly creatures, unique animals, and dangerous enemies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCharacter Customization: Personalize your character with cool skins and unique accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth Mobile Optimization: Enjoy colorful blocky graphics and intuitive controls tailored for your device. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe horizon is waiting for you. Download Crafty Blox World now, grab your weapons, and start building your legacy today!\"],\"Tappy Game\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FrQjnN3VxnoxnRrm39kUtMi7cnkbUoIj99oxOyjfj2jatlzRll3tf1NWs_X0xC95IztyMGL0fQuorzktlBzU\"],null,[132,206,37,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 8.49 - RM 129.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.uc.minigame.relax\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0q5Rt5RGw560SpJrM4qQiFyFW5WwhqJ-3W8ldpF6kLtK3DeRh6JIwWWyWsk-aBDdOrPKBzUSYJNB9Yj7weq9qQ\"],null,[118,205,4,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1024,600],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/n1Zj9q29UFSQ8WotoAmDEWpygKZnUjTEL7V-NC3ndkbsqkW