com/-eiwBb0D_-AlLCIsJH0JiTXLD2c_d8olaGYKe560uY9d_o9-C0l0ihIht2VW68uSpxjBnIX1kQXsjOP-r8Jmmw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o8CoDTcrakz_oSk3S8DSLiIoey6aCG5GJudk3Ltp13mL1rnX_KIGhR6wMI9qQtDWrdIPr66J0cX9MAzecGxXQZQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i1c9PJZ5B2DHxMjh8MA9sk8sy51R9PHnv2iYpc-6Xte7Li8PhGy72Rc8nyPfc9DGWbeTMHBQ3E_w9Tk7ptqd\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lOplhsRf4zksfM_ld6_kNeegS9krRTRyyxh8vF7yVR_AORVlgmlOb-ycXdoqbWVcSkhCtGjt9RzeDWiH2vy77A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JSpqOGAuI4kfwK4JcP7RFFDXNyrCLEzzZvCmJguJ3qUFgpyW9_IZl3UefC3-FzhJNFJibvMZhnrT55ZI08antg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s_d_ZRF3cOgloMVVhuC3cbb6bFvh2CIbDsSX6bRnKtWmbnB4bhE33rI--gEyYfuFuTy4JvGpDAHB7mYId3w7\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s_vdjf_33AWmt9FsBR_RAfNV-1a40i5RxUFjIqUoJMOFIBg_KEdX-w0DU57X9DBBk08EfTo_ngWDqnjUKuE9QA\"]]],\"Bus Crowd - Traffic Jam\",[\"4.4\",4.375],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dbusflow.traffic.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dbusflow.traffic.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dbusflow.traffic.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIT0oTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAocChZidXNmbG93LnRyYWZmaWMucHV6emxlEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Bus Crowd, a colorful bus puzzle game built around traffic jam strategy, passenger matching, and smart parking choices. 🚌🚦\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA crowded station is full of waiting passengers, and buses with different colors and seat capacities are ready to roll. Check the crowd, choose the right vehicle, then move it into an available parking slot for boarding. Fill every seat to release that slot, avoid a parking jam, and keep each Bus Crowd under control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎮 How to Play\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Match Colors and Seats:\\u003c/b\\u003e Empty buses enter the boarding slots to pick up waiting passengers of the same color. Each vehicle has its own capacity, so compare the crowd before making a move.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Follow the Arrows:\\u003c/b\\u003e Move buses from the station into parking slots. Each vehicle can only drive in its arrow direction, so blocked paths need careful observation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Fill Buses to Open Slots:\\u003c/b\\u003e A full vehicle departs and opens its parking space for another move. Avoid leaving buses that are not fully filled in the slots for too long.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Solve the Jam with Strategy:\\u003c/b\\u003e Use color sort logic, bus sort thinking, and car parking style planning to handle every traffic puzzle. 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Use Boosters When Stuck:\\u003c/b\\u003e Helpful boosters can adjust buses, guide passengers, or open paths when a tricky jam blocks your progress. 🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🌟 Game Features\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Bus Jam Puzzle Fun:\\u003c/b\\u003e Mix color matching, passenger boarding, parking slots, and traffic jam choices in a challenge that feels easy to start and satisfying to solve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Bus Out Challenge:\\u003c/b\\u003e Study the arrows, send the right vehicles out of crowded layouts, and enjoy the moment when a blocked station finally starts moving.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Bus Escape Moments:\\u003c/b\\u003e Fill buses, open lanes, and create clever escape style solutions as each full vehicle leaves the station. 🚍\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Traffic Escape Challenge:\\u003c/b\\u003e Handle car jam inspired layouts, parking jam pressure, and bus rush moments with careful observation instead of random moves.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Brain Teaser Levels:\\u003c/b\\u003e Count seats, compare passengers, and use smart strategy to solve each puzzle with a real sense of progress. 🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Passenger Matching Flow:\\u003c/b\\u003e Watch large crowds stream into colorful buses, see vehicles depart one by one, and turn chaos into a smooth boarding flow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Diverse Boosters:\\u003c/b\\u003e Use different tools for buses and passengers, then decide which option gives the best value when the station gets tricky. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e- Bright 3D Station Scenes:\\u003c/b\\u003e Enjoy vivid buses, lively passengers, smooth boarding animations, and relaxing traffic flow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBus Crowd is made for players who enjoy bus games, parking games, bus mania, color sort puzzles, traffic jam puzzles, and clever car jam challenges. Match passengers, fill buses, open parking slots, and solve each bus game with satisfying flow. Download Bus Crowd today and master the jam! 🚦\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact us via: fingerrush.customerservice@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy：https://sites.google.com/view/fingerrushofpp/home\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service：https://sites.google.com/view/finger-rush-of-eula/home\\u003cbr\\u003ePhone: +85259962997\"],\"Hyper Surfer Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GGGcEmYEIhNPrVnbIX7aOo3Lku13mjNoWOzUJYZ4OkypKIWS_N8Z2sD2TPhYo2VTLz5fZ79eVutXhiDx_dpm\"],null,[172,140,148,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dbusflow.traffic.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dbusflow.traffic.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 8.99 - RM 439.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.rc18.ragdoll.shinsonic.monster.playground.sandbox\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mmEb7dCRBazlHhbs9jK4URNBkBOd9x97OUN_I3_H4QBnIvQ82I5funA6YQMdHTgkiBTDOqF0L-xdcNDrbP-l\"],null,[26,26,26,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L-fHxv8dsvkdWXdlxke21tgt-oVTHLSE5pC_m6WrrtqiMy5LHv_spV5dJgBvLLiW5PoFAsPemopsme8c1T6yTw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GIsmidDa2BJmdX7ZOvKOjPuxx9zDSU8Tx3Y9kdIDMSFNycXLFZ67R6zS-Jc7Np3oOHhh1AXDl32Mn3tYLqebUA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yMBZPNgC9EsI9E0-IW7vR5MKF9kjfiYZBjVnK6K5rXbaiSjli50Bx3ajM_P7_1tw9c2YhUnSE0Y2q8ZOIDQV\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UHK-vub-gxlO98Qh7SZ46XH8FV7-n5jCAXeZgSf1bwncUSoHRULEopoXrzd1bbWWWNKYhQgOjNIg8bxAreYg\"]]],\"Brainrot Playground\",[\"3.6\",3.58],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rc18.ragdoll.shinsonic.monster.playground.sandbox\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.rc18.ragdoll.shinsonic.monster.playground.sandbox\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rc18.ragdoll.shinsonic.monster.playground.sandbox\"]],[\"qgKGARqDAQhQShMI2dPxsMeQlwMVOzK3AB3zTSck+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugJXCjsKNWNvbS5yYzE4LnJhZ2RvbGwuc2hpbnNvbmljLm1vbnN0ZXIucGxheWdyb3VuZC5zYW5kYm94EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Brainrot Playground takes ragdoll physics to the next level, delivering an exciting sandbox experience where players can unleash their creativity (or chaos). Step into a dynamic playground where you experiment with Ragdoll characters using a wide array of tools, traps, and monstrous creations. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game features an expanded arsenal of interactive elements, from spike pits and flame throwers to advanced mechanisms. Design intricate setups, build destructive chain reactions, or just revel in the hilarity of ragdoll antics. With an enhanced physics engine, every action leads to satisfyingly unpredictable results, keeping you entertained for hours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBrainrot Playground offers endless possibilities for both casual fun and complex creations. Whether you\\u0026#39;re here for stress relief, creativity, or sheer chaos, this game promises an engaging and lighthearted experience for fans of sandbox and physics-based gameplay.\"],\"Tappy Game\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W87HXaYsH62NujMeHSl0xgirBXFx8k4ggUYmgU