r\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you spot every clever hider before the clock runs out? Pick up your weapon, aim carefully, and shoot to clear every level!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 KEY GAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExciting Seek \\u0026amp; Shoot Gameplay: Explore colorful 3D environments, search for disguised characters, and shoot them down to win!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiverse \\u0026amp; Challenging Maps: From cluttered rooms and farms to crowded party halls—each location is packed with tricky hiding spots.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmart \\u0026amp; Sneaky Targets: Targets blend seamlessly into the environment. Pay close attention to subtle hints and unusual poses!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFast-Paced \\u0026amp; Fun Action: Easy-to-learn controls with instant action—perfect for quick gaming sessions anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStunning 3D Graphics: Enjoy vibrant, stylized visuals and smooth animations that make every hunt satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eObserve the Area: Scan the room carefully to find characters hiding behind furniture or blending into walls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAim \\u0026amp; Shoot: Target the hidden impostors and pull the trigger!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClear the Map: Eliminate all hidden targets within the time limit to earn rewards and unlock new levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to prove your sharp eye and quick trigger finger?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Melon Hunter: Seek n Shoot now and become the ultimate hunter!\"],\"Sprigame\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ukbbD47qNGewJND9xl7dfWTltGgj4tksgBMXeBuKJRtnTUOU3wna1SAbCgxtCjfTRYANXEkaL6JL3bTMKNVAUQ\"],null,[72,39,21,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU