 Epic, Legendary, Rainbow, and Golden Dumplings, you never know what you\\u0026#39;ll find next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Unbox Cute Mystery Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen mystery boxes one by one and enjoy the anticipation of every reveal. Peel the wrapper, open the bamboo steamer, and discover your next adorable dumpling!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Collect \\u0026amp; Complete\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your collection with dumplings of different rarities:\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Common Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e💎 Rare Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Epic Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 Legendary Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Rainbow Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Golden Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Secret Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you collect every dumpling and unlock the rarest surprises?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Relaxing ASMR Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy satisfying unboxing sounds, cute animations, glittery effects, and relaxing reveal moments. Every box is designed to make collecting feel fun, cozy, and satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Discover Every Mystery\\u003cbr\\u003eEach collection has its own theme and hidden surprises. Complete collections to unlock exclusive Secret Dumplings and discover all the special characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Satisfying mystery dumpling unboxing\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Open mystery boxes and reveal surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Cute glitter effects and satisfying animations\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Find Rainbow \\u0026amp; Golden Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Collect dumplings from Common to Legendary\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Complete collections and unlock Secret Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Relaxing ASMR gameplay for a cozy experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnwrap, collect, and discover! Start your Mystery Dumpling Glitter Unbox journey and see if you can find every cute, rare, and secret dumpling! 🥟✨\"],\"HIGAME Studio\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https