rendy clothes, stylish dresses, Y2K tops, chic skirts, shoes, bags, and luxury accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGlamorous Makeup Studio: Complete your look with stunning makeup options—choose hair styles, lipsticks, eye shadows, and accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJudge \\u0026amp; Win: Score votes, win trophies, earn gems, and climb the global leaderboards to prove your styling prowess.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDaily Style Challenges: Join daily events and seasonal fashion shows to unlock exclusive designer outfits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you love fashion design, makeover games, or competitive dress-up challenges, Fashion Arena: Dress Up Game is your personal runway. Express your creativity, master every dress code, and dominate the arena today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Fashion Arena: Dress Up Game now and start your glamorous journey!\"],\"Sprigame\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_YPaETw5hooBVbhUUERxbPRcT1vEooEYMdNr5mJTzkNr9TSlZn_O8mjAWHuw6N6L1WFmPwYSkjLr2fK7OnkcV8c\"],null,[244,235,238,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/sto