60,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/al0eCtDd3KaAvbGSmtsAKs_s4iECDTCi1nZzQn90ArMAemV_Jn_Df03TbcSFWNCiZ0pO6ohFYhcKHQglBBM_Lg\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GNy4O_LPihoECU4-UZlQQHrRvaDMAfBuTJj1s_fZ5P5Ttom-iHsLZWwPwgeGVgzU168RjrGMtN9wZmkOhA4YJA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fE2bt15hSbrUPxKwzoA-4akhkEGUK2Bia2pFmqCxA2mKGephdj4OWOIg-skKh8eu5fiOAbSiWroGNQCTdt5ql1U\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9bolbEdFjjSrheLCXUx-8qTmGXtjOPvXA2WaoXOBUQY5lBs4X-pladStdQQpM2-2oyDayIvYblCaVOpltPnU4g\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2KodMgCHu7Mrtumf0zwgvf8jLEVpSqp5BqwZTuAZiXZleFy7bpQ0vlKHpKKP5AU3zKOq6JdXePvAvzHxANHfNg\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OmUwzFQ6ecX0p-hwN5H0VLJUKEQRPIzXro-5Qzo_5TYxkgzqRsFAubyfK3WtA6fNYEA4TUlCbK5sVqtUjUct\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/al0eCtDd3KaAvbGSmtsAKs_s4iECDTCi1nZzQn90ArMAemV_Jn_Df03TbcSFWNCiZ0pO6ohFYhcKHQglBBM_Lg\"]]],\"World Flags: Color Puzzle\",[\"4.3\",4.3416667],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026rdid\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIVkoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgoeChhjYXN1YWwuZmxhZ3Mud29ybGQuY29sb3IQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Get ready to embark on a vibrant journey with World Flags: Color Puzzle, the ultimate game for flag enthusiasts and puzzle lovers alike! If you have a passion for national flags and a flair for colors, this hyper-casual game is tailor-made for you. 🖌️🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Global Challenge of Colors and Flags:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨🌍 Welcome to the Colorful World of World Flags: Color Puzzle! 🌟🏳️\\u200d🌈 In the World Flags: Color Puzzle, your mission is to paint the national flags of the world with the right colors. This isn\\u0026#39;t just about painting; it\\u0026#39;s about testing your knowledge and memory of different national flags. Can you remember the colors of each flag and recreate them accurately?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy World Flags: Color Puzzle is Irresistibly Fun:\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Test Your Flag Knowledge: Challenge your recognition skills by drawing and painting various national flags. It’s a fun way to learn and remember the flags of the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Easy Gameplay, Challenging Memory Test: While the gameplay is straightforward, remembering and correctly coloring each flag offers a satisfying challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Engaging Levels: With a multitude of flags to color, each level presents a new opportunity to test your memory and painting skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Perfect for All Ages: Whether you’re a geography buff, a casual gamer, or a curious learner, World Flags: Color Puzzle is suitable for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to put your flag knowledge to the test and have loads of fun while doing it? Download World Flags: Color Puzzle now and start your artistic and puzzle journey around the globe! Embark on a colorful exploration of national flags with World Flags: Color Puzzle! Download now and start painting! 🌈🌏📲\"],\"kiwilab\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B_vAk9G6tmao_HLhgct4sjhqiSj1MyFm-SgN3FlVtiqSz7GCGEzFDoJJrVK7p_e68mzfjyKDIjbN2q1k0q71eQ\"],null,[244,242,241,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexil