03dcom.metax.find.it.spooky.morphs.incredibox\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIWEoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRgowCipjb20ubWV0YXguZmluZC5pdC5zcG9va3kubW9ycGhzLmluY3JlZGlib3gQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Explore mysterious worlds, discover hidden characters, and unlock them all in a fun sandbox adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter a colorful world filled with unique characters waiting to be discovered. Explore different areas, search every corner of the map, and uncover characters hidden throughout your journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🗺 EXPLORE 4 UNIQUE MAPS\\u003cbr\\u003eTravel across 4 different maps, each with its own environment and collection of characters to discover. Look around carefully and explore every area to find them all.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔎 FIND HIDDEN CHARACTERS\\u003cbr\\u003eCharacters can be found throughout each map. Explore freely, search different locations, and keep your eyes open for characters hiding in unexpected places.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔓 UNLOCK \\u0026amp; COLLECT\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover a character to add it to your collection. Keep exploring to unlock more characters and work toward completing your collection across all 4 maps.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 PLAY YOUR WAY\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a simple sandbox experience where exploration is the main goal. Move around the map, investigate your surroundings, and discover new characters at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ COMPLETE YOUR COLLECTION\\u003cbr\\u003eHow many characters can you find? Explore every map and unlock as many unique characters as possible. Each discovery brings you one step closer to completing your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 DISCOVER SOMETHING NEW\\u003cbr\\u003eWith multiple maps and plenty of characters to find, there is always another area to explore. Take your time, search carefully, and see what you can discover next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eR