00nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQoZChNjb20uYW1hbm90ZXMuZ3MuZzA2EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"UoQqRTMRL1Y\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:UoQqRTMRL1Y?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:UoQqRTMRL1Y\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezknU07yrbjK2oxog_2vRvldsKm5LiBw3QRSjJTL7Uz-fw8e5qBmV6uzTOfkKNjLXq57JjQ-sukKGQ0-X87f1HpRlfPAQ32A1OgvptYi_1pEIZagNHflm-fRNccc6G-HOuWxfLHNWbEAKVCUkeCZm6sSXKtSCvGD5Jl7_DmrKg_arDdPyZ1o7LFOkN8o4Iaw-Zi1Lth9fb2-OZhtes3IX53P2UNfcX0IRXMI7yVlNM5F_zOIrnwRMRby08mB5wtyI4AzJf9kiq1_xpJ_VjfgbWwCQ0OjnRF4-Hq5TLhKejVQEQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UoQqRTMRL1Y/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Everyone Can Meow Meow! Real meows. Viral songs. Adorable rhythm fun. Duet Cats stands out in the cat music genre with heartfelt harmony, cozy charm, signature duet gameplay, and exciting new features to explore.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlending authentic meow sounds with catchy rhythms, Duet Cats turns every play session into a feel-good cat concert you will want to come back to. Meow hop to the beat, enjoy playful duet rhythm action, and dive into a cat music game that is easy to pick up, fun to master, and made to keep players coming back.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNow with even more features, Duet Cats is more than a rhythm game. Discover a bigger world of songs, cats, rewards, cozy customization, and playful side activities in one content-filled meow-verse.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRHYTHM FUN WITH A CUTE TWIST\\u003cbr\\u003e• Meow hop to the beat and catch falling treats in time with the music\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy signature duet gameplay with your cat duo in every song\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy a relaxing casual game with catchy beats and playful meow sounds\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA BIG WORLD OF SONGS AND CATS\\u003cbr\\u003e• 150+ songs to play, including trendy vibes and phonk-inspired energy\\u003cbr\\u003e• 150+ cats to collect, from cute everyday kitties to special event cats\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover seasonal content inspired by summer, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, Easter, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e• Build your dream lineup of furry stars, each with their own charm\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY EVERY DAY, EARN EVERY DAY\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete Daily Tasks for extra rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e• Reach Milestones and claim even more bonus gifts\\u003cbr\\u003e• Use boosters like Magnet, Frog, and Extra Heart to keep your run going\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTAKE CARE OF YOUR CATS\\u003cbr\\u003e• Feed your kitties and collect free rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e• Keep your furry friends happy through Cat Feeding\\u003cbr\\u003e• Turn every session into a cozy, rewarding pet moment\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDECORATE YOUR CAT ROOM\\u003cbr\\u003e• Collect lovely items and build a space your cats will love\\u003cbr\\u003e• Create a warm, charming room filled with cute cat style\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMORE THAN A RHYTHM GAME\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy mini puzzle modes like Matchy Cats, Blocky Cats, Match-3 Foods, and Linky Cats\\u003cbr\\u003e• Switch between relaxing collection gameplay and fun side challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you want a rhythm game that feels cute, cozy, rewarding, and easy to love, Duet Cats is ready for you. Tap with your kitty duo, enjoy every duet song, collect your favorite cats, and build your own meow-filled world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Duet Cats now and start your cutest music adventure today.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.amanotes.com/privacy-policy/\"],\"AMANOTES PTE. LTD.\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JQDVSqmptQFwHewPOaBoXrLnGzqjHz6OcFLw_Y8MAGwqa9R8Tid1dCt6-LN4r9kmbrGaoCWgI5hGb_T3z5UkFg