U9loR5sp2ecp0HbyxTSpO9MwSRdcW16nCrXqr4MkOsoVT6PZByUzaA9bvoO6sw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KY8n7B4wq9H0kx6VrmfrUXnu7PighfSM1bCEWmy-RUrVU_QUHljigpZ2kFSwHPix_HzjroWW79Eo1myf8nov\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CJ7mbcR6SqW_DwVmSxxI30BcL_FR0a149NPBsnnPPX2AHltKzzav4c2k8dOPD2R5BkBSsas5wndeW_wAr5MoLXA\"]]],\"Hospital Story: Perfect Care\",[\"4.2\",4.19802],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.higame.par.hospital.management.perfect.simulator.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.higame.par.hospital.management.perfect.simulator.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.higame.par.hospital.management.perfect.simulator.game\"]],[\"qgKKARqHAQheShMI2dPxsMeQlwMVOzK3AB3zTSck+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugJbCj8KOWNvbS5oaWdhbWUucGFyLmhvc3BpdGFsLm1hbmFnZW1lbnQucGVyZmVjdC5zaW11bGF0b3IuZ2FtZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Hospital Story: Perfect Care is a highly engaging and entertaining mobile game that takes you on a journey to become the ultimate hospital manager. Hurry up doctor, we have an emergency! A pregnant woman is on her way in the ambulance to give birth, and there is a patient waiting in the lab to perform different medical tests to get a diagnosis to his illness and be able to cure him. There\\u0026#39;s a lot to be done!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHospital Story: Perfect Care is an advanced hospital, full of activities for the whole family and things to do, where countless adventures and stories between doctors and patients waits for you inside their facilities full of interactions and surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Doll house, pretend play game which takes place in a modern hospital. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Infinite ways to play on floors with medical units: family doctor consultation, maternity, intensive care nursing unit for children and another one for adults, operating room and staff room.\\u003cbr\\u003e- In Addition to the reception there are several common areas that you can also explore: A waiting room, an ambulance entrance and a restaurant.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play with characters of different species, ages and genres, representing different roles, both patients and hospital staff.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Create Stories: Use your imagination to create stories with different characters available. These characters include doctors, nurses, patients in different scenarios, such as helping a pregnant woman give birth, diagnosing illnesses, or performing surgeries.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Interact with Objects: There are many objects and interactions to explore. You can use medical equipment, prepare meals in the hospital restaurant, or find hidden surprises in different rooms.\\u003cbr\\u003e- No Rules or Goals: The game is designed to be open-ended, allowing you to play however you like. There are no specific goals or rules, so you can let your creativity run wild. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Hospital Story: Perfect Care now and enjoy creating your own hospital adventures!\"],\"HIGAME LTD.\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zOduBFiHszyXxKwaQo2JQ0T-YOLZ5PQQvNXDORyosjDMcRxXkbXFfjB34OQQL2Hv3d9YgeM5_PMGsXHn3H4c\"],null,[235,233,228,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Sui