smooth gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTry it out and enjoy the experience at your own pace. Includes a mix of soft sounds and smooth gameplay, giving you a relaxing gaming experience anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDestress Relaxing Games Quality Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiple anti-stress games with ASMR sounds.\\u003cbr\\u003eTap the hint button whenever you need a little help.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollection of destress games with smooth gameplay.\"],\"Mad1 Games\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YNOdH4-pW5tHctxcUcbSZQecBauwkwvL3WS5MslKV73CanYuqQel6O3nc8vGWTaPpf6jRX5YB9KhJKVETjsA\"],null,[151,168,93,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.genz.drestress.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.genz.drestress.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 23.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,nul