/play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:A1KvBFJLV1c?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:A1KvBFJLV1c\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmySYbsJ9W75fZQT_LhZcenTAnvbl_hlZNBefNYGRClK6JGGfRgvDlC3SlvwxLtTy9ix6JoBTCqixxw_uEq_YvFNP9d_nrUrf8gaYzQF5c1fVSujCszJf5gGR6icaPjkFWU0iTrZGQoYE5xUTzgGuofNaIV2DbgikOIIFAWD9Ud9X_qMvmTUa7T7K4CjHnqJavsJZ4HWku7KpzbZWgqeXWIPunAqe6OhtQIuIpC0EG5UT488sImyYXsUh0k9lBHrc25Tx_zD1j8YPJ3kHDnaEzUFGf-TrEjwwP0XyXOvztfkg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A1KvBFJLV1c/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Candy Crush Soda Saga is a bright and cheerful puzzle game full of fizzy fun, sweet candy, and satisfying match 3 moments. Whether you want a quick break or a proper pastime, this sweet game is easy to enjoy anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍭 Why it stands out?\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Soda Saga adds a bubbly twist to classic matching games with creative level goals, lively visuals, and fun modes like Bubblegum Pop and Gummy Dragons. Each board feels fresh, light, and rewarding.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Match, blast, and keep the fun going!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay through thousands of matching levels packed with sweet surprises\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy match 3 puzzles with playful twists and soda-filled challenges\\u003cbr\\u003eUse boosters to blast blockers and clear tricky boards\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover Bubblegum Pop, soda-filled boards, and sticky jelly levels that change how you play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✈️ Play your way!\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a relaxing session offline or go online for events, rewards, and games with friends. Whether you are on the go or taking a break at home, this offline game fits right into your day. It is a cheerful puzzle game that turns any moment into a fun pastime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍬 Sweet features in every level!\\u003cbr\\u003eBig cascades, bright effects, and clever obstacles make every pop soda moment satisfying. Match candies, clear the board, and enjoy fresh twists that keep the action lively. Fans of matching games will love the mix of fun challenges, colorful worlds, and easy pick-up-and-play excitement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍩 Daily rewards and more to explore!\\u003cbr\\u003eThere is always something new waiting. Collect daily rewards, join special events, and take on extra challenges with players\\u0026#39; competition. Play offline for a quick session or stay longer for more match 3 action.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Frequently asked questions\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat is Candy Crush Soda Saga?\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Soda Saga is a casual puzzle game packed with colorful match 3 challenges, sweet boosters, and unique game modes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan I play without wifi?\\u003cbr\\u003eYes. You can enjoy many levels offline, making it a great offline game for travel, breaks, or everyday play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes it different?\\u003cbr\\u003eCreative level types, cookie blockers, soda-filled boards, and playful matching fun make every level feel fresh.\\u003cbr\\u003eStart matching, enjoy the fizz, and dive into a world of candy-filled fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Soda Saga is free to play but optional in-game items such as extra moves or lives require payment. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device’s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading Candy Crush Soda Saga you agree to our terms of service which can be found at https://king.com/termsAndConditions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by going to https://soporto.king.com/contact\"],\"King\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P5NA4lAVj-AlDV7K_07VbqDYXVjwa174tdDMPPoqbFWF3726ETv-FmVZNGUMOUSDEBWRGpJgdQFgJxW-Tqv1RA\"],null,[43,48,104,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Location, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrushsodasaga\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.candycrushsodasaga\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 0.99 - RM 279.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.tiny.medical.idle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EfZ5m9ja8IqxJKo4tywnRcpunJOThObvDjB9keq4MMfdc6PEuuVW3b6fBY3gI0i9T0U8Ub2Ure75wZfXJpRzDf0\"],null,[13,158,249,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jh4BFJAknbsgcQWeCJrp-D8DYlgIuz5kfaFABZepdGurauaFYv3dPG5tUBvrlndO_kIkgi4ohstOdBBKN4hxGQ\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D7U5ZScns9Qsbx-3IYcW9_xjAxJUeqRqgSHV2a6zuOD1rmJCV7_9Ndlx61V89O910UjMQt_-IqhuFPJtpnTy\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LqX2xMuQUQVSonOstoYcLBf2vhsyOJRIHTLHmiKTFpGaMNOa97XiuVYt1KheKe4ASXpbISJFEaA9UajgJNjT1A\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q1Yz_Tz2ixaG5jcIyQDPSIPJe5xeC4RwjH807Paf8VVcHxUizmjzvGThF4wYpQklX6rCu9CNrUGPJj0-KTj0\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cHisgzOYD5cmol4iVMblbEUcdm29OVfV8Kjxh5AepiErv_TnNmLsNKDJK2fm9Yn6yw-dCtOdZ007eDhOdfZRcUc\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dyaDd9o8-fhQvZk_BgxpPAAEFmS5B3AVeAwsGZ2TPKvO8chRV-jU85DjcNgpksNUw1UsHp4DPA0CnY25QkJosxE\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H54u69Fc3r1OoObaB84pFLkgfnwyN92i3lIorUwshlIMttCreZnx5F728ds1YgE-CVlI7t4C5-ZTwl7UreO6\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KxSd3MA70ZdMmGjislfZsA20EIcAbAnDAtmHZIqbeiY45hCpI1K1nsD5l_tTKX__3wYaTGeDVyeJUdMJX3x-QQ\"]]],\"Tiny Medical Idle\",[\"4.9\",4.903226],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIYUoTCNnT8bDHkJcDFTsytwAd800nJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwobChVjb20udGlueS5tZWRpY2FsLmlkbGUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Tiny Medical Idle is a relaxing, stress-relieving idle casual hospital simulation game. Step into the role of a hospital director, build your very own miniature medical paradise from scratch, and enjoy the simple, comforting fun of hospital management.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game features five independent medical production lines: Outpatient Clinic, CT Room, Operating Room, Pharmacy, and Ward. These five lines run separately, generating resources and gold coins respectively with no mandatory workflow connections. The Outpatient Clinic receives incoming patients and provides steady basic income, serving as the core for early capital accumulation. The CT Room operates with professional medical equipment to deliver higher single-session returns. The Operating Room boasts high earnings and is the key line for amassing large amounts of gold coins. The Pharmacy runs non-stop, consistently bringing in considerable revenue. The Ward generates a steady stream of income to support the steady expansion of your hospital. Each line fulfills its own function. You are free to choose your priority development direction, with full control over your gameplay pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse the gold coins earned from operations to upgrade and strengthen the five production lines. Upgrades improve processing efficiency, raise the maximum single-session yield, and speed up overall operation. When a production line reaches specific levels, brand-new workstations and a wealth of exquisite themed decorations will be unlocked. Upgrading the Outpatient Clinic unlocks more consultation workstations, along with decorative items such as modern desks, chairs and medical record cabinets. Upgrading the CT Room unlocks brand-new scanning equipment paired with sleek, tech-inspired medical ornaments. Upgrading the Operating Room opens more surgical workstations and unlocks sterile-style scene decorations. Upgrading the Pharmacy expands dispensing workstations and unlocks a wide array of medicine shelves and display props. Upgrading the Ward unlocks more hospital beds, as well as soft furnishings including curtains, nightstands and green plants. All decorations can be freely used to spruce up your hospital, and some also provide extra stat bonuses, boosting both your hospital’s appearance and profit-making ability at the same time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game focuses on a laid-back idle experience, with no brain-taxing complex strategic puzzles or stressful time-limited missions, making it perfect for playing in short, fragmented sessions. While the game is running, all production lines operate automatically and gold coins keep accumulating. All you need to do is continuously reinvest your earnings into upgrading and expanding your hospital.\"],\"Solid Games\",\"1,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OupKy1Rq1AK6HYH8cOroSZuWab53AkSJQKAKynY-x-DFlpxd4FcOn0sS_la0fc81M1-wgDT3731FNKi5wK3a\"],null,[153,154,158,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 4.49 - RM 124.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,